#2
Limbo~
   You are floating in a formless void, detached from all sensation of physical
matter, surrounded by swirling glowing light, which fades into the relative
darkness around you without any trace of edges or shadow.
   There is a "No Tipping" notice pinned to the darkness.
~
0 16908 1
S
#3
Rip's Ward~
	You see a bunch of vicious looking henchmen standing around
the room to kick you out if you do not belong here.  Strait jackets
and other instruments to keep Rip from hurting anyone lie around the room
unused.  Apparently said instruments weren't very useful.  There is a plan
for exterminating all the players on the MUD on a desk which also holds
a VT320 terminal thru which the world is manipulated.
~
0 8|512 1
S
#4
Phantom's office~
	This is the office of Phantom.  You see a great stone desk in the 
center of the room. The walls are covered with beautify murals. A huge window
overlooks the town of Hell.   Behind the desk sits a huge recliner, just
waiting for someone like you to sit in it.
~
