#7
El Teatro de Yankee~
The room is relatively dark, but if you look closely, you can see worn 
out movie posters on the walls for various horror films like  "Friday the 
13th", and "Halloween".  At the far end of the room is a film screen.  On 
it plays continuos scenes of violence and mayhem.  The floor is littered
with assorted knives, daggers and axes.  The foul stench of decomposing 
bodies fills the air.  You notice a sillhouted figure in the corner with
a jar of ky jelly.......waiting for you to bend over.
~
